cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PaScal Suite Python in your research, please cite this software."
title: "PaScal Suite Python: Reproducible Regional Energy Telemetry for Mathematical Optimization Solvers on HPC Systems"
type: software
abstract: >-
  PaScal Suite Python is a research-oriented wrapper for reproducible,
  region-aware time and energy experiments with Gurobi and SCIP through
  PaScal Analyzer on HPC systems.
